---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy policy · Best Case Studio"
  description="How Best Case Studio collects, uses, and protects your personal data. Two-person studio, no ad trackers, no data selling."
  breadcrumbs={[
    { name: 'Home', url: '/' },
    { name: 'Privacy', url: '/privacy/' },
  ]}
>
  <section class="legal">
    <div class="wrap-article">
      <p class="eyebrow mono">Privacy</p>
      <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
      <p class="updated">Last updated: 1 July 2026</p>

      <p>
        Best Case Studio is a two-person studio (Jon and Jessie McGreevy) producing B2B case
        studies. This policy explains what personal data we collect, why, and what you can do
        about it. Any questions, email <a href="mailto:jon@bestcasestud.io">jon@bestcasestud.io</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Information you give us.</strong> When you email us, fill in a form, or book a
          call, we collect your name, email address, company, and anything else you choose to
          tell us.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Booking data.</strong> We use Calendly to schedule discovery calls. When you
          book, Calendly processes your name, email, and scheduling details on our behalf.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Technical data.</strong> Our host, Cloudflare, processes standard server logs
          (such as IP address and browser type) to serve and secure the site. We don't run
          advertising or cross-site tracking.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How we use it</h2>
      <p>
        We use your data to reply to you, run discovery calls, deliver our services, and operate
        and secure the website. Our lawful bases are performing a contract with you and our
        legitimate interest in running the studio. We do not sell your data or use it for
        advertising.
      </p>

      <h2>Who we share it with</h2>
      <p>
        We share data only with the service providers who help us run the business — Calendly
        (scheduling), our email provider, and Cloudflare (hosting and security) — and they
        process it on our instructions. Some providers are based outside the UK; where they are,
        they rely on appropriate safeguards for international transfers. We may also disclose
        data if the law requires it.
      </p>

      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        The site itself sets no marketing cookies. Calendly may set cookies when you use its
        booking widget — see Calendly's own privacy policy for details.
      </p>

      <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
      <p>
        We keep enquiry and client data for as long as we need it to deliver our services and
        meet legal and accounting obligations, then delete it.
      </p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        Under UK GDPR you can ask us to access, correct, or delete your data, or object to how
        we use it. Email <a href="mailto:jon@bestcasestud.io">jon@bestcasestud.io</a> and we'll
        respond within one month. You can also complain to the Information Commissioner's Office
        at <a href="https://ico.org.uk/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">ico.org.uk</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this policy from time to time. The "last updated" date above shows when it
        last changed.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .legal {
    background: var(--bg);
    padding: 180px 0 120px;
  }
  .eyebrow {
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    margin: 0 0 20px;
  }
  h1 {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: clamp(40px, 5.5vw, 72px);
    line-height: 1.0;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    margin: 0 0 16px;
  }
  .updated {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    margin: 0 0 48px;
  }
  h2 {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: clamp(24px, 3vw, 32px);
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    margin: 48px 0 16px;
  }
  p,
  li {
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  p {
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    max-width: 68ch;
  }
  ul {
    padding-left: 0;
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    max-width: 68ch;
  }
  li {
    padding: 10px 0 10px 22px;
    position: relative;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }
  li::before {
    content: '—';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--pink);
  }
  li strong {
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  a {
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
    text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
  }
  a:hover {
    color: var(--pink);
  }
</style>
